                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      h3. Context<br/>
Several measures determine whether anything else can be published at all: identity match, product match, reconciliation between what was sent and returned, and feed freshness.<br/>
<br/>
h3. Problem / opportunity<br/>
A product that degrades quietly is worse than one that stops. Without floors and automatic suppression, figures continue to be published on incomplete data and the failure is discovered by an advertiser rather than by us.<br/>
<br/>
h3. Objective<br/>
Compute the quality measures daily, hold each against a floor, and withhold dependent figures automatically when a floor is breached.<br/>
<br/>
h3. Business outcome / value<br/>
* A wrong number is never published in place of a missing one<br/>
* Problems surface within a day rather than in a quarterly review<br/>
* Every campaign can state up front what can honestly be reported about it<br/>
<br/>
h3. In scope<br/>
* Daily computation of identity match, product match, export-to-return reconciliation and feed freshness<br/>
* A defined floor per measure, with breach detection and alerting<br/>
* Automatic suppression of figures whose inputs are below floor, with the reason retained<br/>
* A measurability status per campaign, stating what can be reported and why<br/>
* Breach history, so a degrading trend is visible before it becomes a breach<br/>
<br/>
h3. Out of scope<br/>
* Fixing the underlying data quality, which sits with the source systems<br/>
* Presentation, which is a separate epic<br/>
<br/>
h3. Acceptance criteria<br/>
* A breached floor withholds the affected figures automatically, with the reason available<br/>
* Measurability status is computed per campaign before any figure is displayed<br/>
* A simulated breach is detectable end to end within the same day<br/>
* No suppressed figure is rendered as a zero or a blank anywhere<br/>
<br/>
h3. Measure of success<br/>
* Floors computed and published every day with no gaps<br/>
* Every suppression carries a stated reason<br/>
* No incident in which a figure was published on data below floor<br/>
<br/>
h3. Dependencies and open issues<br/>
# Ingestion, identity resolution, product mapping and export extension
  </td>
